SPOILER WARNING!!!!!!!!!


































You can get water in a few other ways, but you have to waste potions
to do so.  If you #dip a potion (or potions) in a fountain, they may
dilute and become water.  If you #dip a potion slot into a potion of water,
the potions will dilute, and the water you dipped it in goes away.  If
you dip a normal or blessed unicorn horn into a potion of sickness,
hallucination, or blindness, the potion dilutes.  If you zap a potion
with a wand of cancellation, it dilutes.  Be very careful.  Finally,
if you blunder into a pool, but survive by auto-teleportation and
luck, your potions may dilute.
